<title>GREECE: Natl Mortgage Bank launches branch in Col.</title>
<headline>Natl Mortgage Bank launches branch in Col.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>State National Mortgage Bank of Greece launched a new branch in Cologne, Germany at Gereonstrasse 18-30, it said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The bank's objective is its entry in the German market with a series of products that will prove attractive not only to residents of Greek descent but local residents as well,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Inaugurating the branch on Saturday was National Mortgage Bank's governor Vassilis Rapanos joined by Greece's ambassador to Germany and other officials. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
